This project is an independent, clean-room modern rewrite inspired by the
architecture and design ideas of the original PHPServer (v1.3.4, PHP 5.6 era),
a multi-process PHP RPC server originally developed and used in production at
Jumei (聚美优品).

It contains no source code, configuration, or documentation from the original
project. The original's core idea is kept: simple and slight — a master
process preforking workers, a select-based event loop, and a two-hook worker
contract (dealInput / dealProcess).

The names "PHPServer" and "Jumei" are used only to describe provenance. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Jumei.

